      "description": "The world seen from water\n\nWater is a fundamental element. In wet exploration that started in 2007 the world is photographed from the water in order to make the viewer not only discovering urban or country landscape from a very different angle but also to take conscience that we are surrounded by this amazing yet necessary element. \n \nSo Far wet exploration takes you from the alps to nyc via marseille, dominican republic, canada and mexico.",
